<title>ITALY: DHL appoints new human resources director.</title>
<headline>DHL appoints new human resources director.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL Worldwide Express said it has appointed Danilo Villa as human resources director for Italy.</p>
<p>Villa was responsible for human resources and organisation within the South Europeran service division having previously been personnel director for North Italy. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
